<section class="founder-story section-shell">
  <div class="founder-story__copy">
    <h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
    <p>When I first became obsessed with the science of longevity, I kept seeing the same pattern.</p>
    <p><strong>The most interesting tools—NAD+, advanced wellness protocols and clinical-style testing—were often expensive, confusing or only available to people with access to private clinics.</strong></p>
  </div>
  <img src="{{ 'founder-desktop-clear.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Founder of Cata-Kor" loading="lazy" width="800" height="900">
  <div class="founder-story__quote">
    <p>My goal was never to make another supplement brand. It was to build a company for people who want to feel better for longer—without making longevity complicated or out of reach.</p>
    <strong>Founder of Cata-Kor</strong>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Founder story",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Longevity, made accessible"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Founder story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
